WEBVTT

00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:06.930
I'm delighted, Kain Arisugawa.

00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:08.600
That's impossible!

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:10.940
Me being Kain in the past?

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:14.110
Then why would my ID data be missing?

00:00:14.110 --> 00:00:18.200
And what about Sam Taylor,
who looks exactly like Kain?

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:19.950
His body must be a clone then.

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:21.120
That's possible.

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:25.830
The clone has different experiences than the original,
so his biological data could be different too.

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:29.080
Yes, the only sinner here is your mind.

00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:30.710
Your body is at no fault.

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:32.120
Really?

00:00:32.120 --> 00:00:37.250
To Mind Trance into a clone must mean that
if you're not within a certain distance...

00:00:37.250 --> 00:00:38.410
Precisely!

00:00:38.410 --> 00:00:40.060
Just as I expected, Kain.

00:00:40.060 --> 00:00:45.440
This technology can only be perfected by you and the unparalleled amount of neurons in your body.

00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:52.110
Are you trying to obtain eternal life by wandering from body to body forever starting with Kain's clone?

00:00:52.110 --> 00:00:58.090
While it's true there are old people who want
exactly this, you're wrong about me.

00:00:58.090 --> 00:01:02.500
I want to make you atone for
your sins by your own body.

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:03.750
To atone?

00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:08.460
Hmph. So if I'm Kain the sinner,
then who are you?

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:12.250
Triwaker, the third of your clones.

00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:17.640
Oh, are you going to name the next
one Kain Tetrawaker or what?

00:01:17.640 --> 00:01:20.640
Do you really not remember, Kain?

00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:24.160
Me, Addams Forte Chevalier?

00:01:24.720 --> 00:01:26.060
I'm dejected!

00:01:26.810 --> 00:01:29.730
Even though we were sworn friends!

00:03:11.150 --> 00:03:12.490
Sworn friends?

00:03:12.490 --> 00:03:15.340
Sworn friends, you said?
Me and you, really?

00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:16.760
Exactly, Kain.

00:03:16.760 --> 00:03:19.050
I know everything about you.

00:03:19.050 --> 00:03:25.130
Your education, personality, favorite food, your type of women. Aah! Everything!

00:03:25.130 --> 00:03:27.270
He said his name was Addams, right?

00:03:27.650 --> 00:03:29.350
Addams Forte Chevalier

00:03:29.560 --> 00:03:35.260
After developing the Mind Trance System with Kain Arisugawa and Jennifer Record,

00:03:35.260 --> 00:03:37.320
he and Jennifer went missing.

00:03:37.530 --> 00:03:40.490
So he's been calling himself Kain
for a while now?

00:03:40.490 --> 00:03:43.880
Kain! Does my name really ring no bells?

00:03:43.880 --> 00:03:45.540
It's Addams!

00:03:45.540 --> 00:03:46.880
You must remember!

00:03:46.880 --> 00:03:48.710
If you really are alive!

00:03:48.710 --> 00:03:49.340
Mr. Ido!

00:03:50.890 --> 00:03:51.970
You hear?!

00:03:51.970 --> 00:03:55.140
I'm the one who made your body like this!

00:03:55.140 --> 00:03:57.350
Remember it! Hate me!

00:03:57.350 --> 00:04:00.590
And scream out my name!

00:04:04.850 --> 00:04:08.980
Dammit, can't they at least contact
us to say if they've made it?

00:04:08.980 --> 00:04:12.630
Pops, MT Industries is close,
I'll take a look.

00:04:12.630 --> 00:04:14.770
Somehow I just have a horrible feeling.

00:04:16.120 --> 00:04:18.200
I agree, I'll go as well.

00:04:19.870 --> 00:04:21.120
Mr. Ido.

00:04:21.990 --> 00:04:25.040
Mr. Ido, hang in there! Mr. Ido!

00:04:25.040 --> 00:04:26.340
That's odd.

00:04:26.340 --> 00:04:29.880
Ido should be able to easily
dodge attacks like those.

00:04:29.880 --> 00:04:32.290
Kain, you really can't remember?

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:34.800
Then I'll have to just eliminate you here.

00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:37.260
No way, his own body?

00:04:37.260 --> 00:04:39.580
You should've never appeared again...

00:04:39.580 --> 00:04:40.300
Wait!

00:04:40.300 --> 00:04:40.810
Hmm?

00:04:40.810 --> 00:04:47.890
I held up my end of the bargain about bringing Ido and Alice here, but my reward is nowhere in sight.

00:04:47.890 --> 00:04:49.820
Give me back my body!

00:04:50.150 --> 00:04:50.770
Body?

00:04:50.770 --> 00:04:52.570
Return your body?

00:04:52.570 --> 00:04:55.940
I see. That's a good idea.

00:04:55.940 --> 00:04:58.940
That's right, I could've just done that..

00:04:59.340 --> 00:05:02.330
Alright then, I'll fulfill my promise.

00:05:37.240 --> 00:05:38.030
Ido!

00:05:47.660 --> 00:05:48.700
Hmm.

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:53.130
Karla-Milla Foden was in Mind Trance for 10 years, but she seems to be fine.

00:05:53.130 --> 00:05:55.630
Ms. Karla! Ms. Karla!

00:05:55.630 --> 00:05:57.960
Then you should be fine as well.

00:05:57.960 --> 00:06:01.010
As your friend, I'll put all my
heart into this gesture.

00:06:05.680 --> 00:06:08.640
This is an act of mercy, Kain.

00:06:26.700 --> 00:06:28.030
Mr. Ido...

00:06:37.460 --> 00:06:40.460
I...

00:06:41.010 --> 00:06:44.820
It might be a clone of your own body,
but you've still been apart for 30 years.

00:06:44.820 --> 00:06:47.180
There are bound to be some difficulties.

00:06:47.180 --> 00:06:49.560
Let's confirm it all again to be sure.

00:06:50.110 --> 00:06:52.700
My past, Kain.

00:06:52.700 --> 00:06:53.900
And yours.

00:06:55.790 --> 00:07:02.110
The Mind Trance System uses Orichalt to transfer someone's consciousness data...

00:07:02.320 --> 00:07:03.780
Mr. Ido's memories?

00:07:03.780 --> 00:07:10.300
The consciousness data of yours truly, Kain Arisugawa, is present right in this machine.

00:07:10.300 --> 00:07:13.750
This technology is one you could call necessary for an age of space exploration.

00:07:13.750 --> 00:07:16.160
The Mind Trance System.

00:07:17.210 --> 00:07:19.380
The presentation results were superb.

00:07:19.380 --> 00:07:22.300
We're getting investors one after another.

00:07:22.460 --> 00:07:24.730
To the success of the Mind Trance system!

00:07:25.260 --> 00:07:26.760
Thank you, Kain.

00:07:26.760 --> 00:07:29.560
We should be able to save Alice now.

00:07:29.560 --> 00:07:33.540
Big bro Kain, will my sickness
really get better?

00:07:33.540 --> 00:07:34.570
Of course.

00:07:34.570 --> 00:07:39.520
If we move your consciousness into an I-machine,
it should stabilize your mind.

00:07:39.940 --> 00:07:45.010
Even if it's inside a machine,
as long as Alice can stay alive...

00:07:45.010 --> 00:07:46.950
This girl is my hope!

00:07:49.410 --> 00:07:50.880
Alice?

00:07:53.240 --> 00:07:55.180
Alice! Alice!

00:07:55.180 --> 00:07:57.690
Stay with us, Alice! Alice!

00:07:59.760 --> 00:08:01.670
The system isn't completed yet!

00:08:01.670 --> 00:08:03.380
Transferring her in critical
condition would be...

00:08:03.380 --> 00:08:05.800
But there isn't any other
way to save her!

00:08:06.890 --> 00:08:07.970
I guess there's no choice...

00:08:07.970 --> 00:08:09.570
MT System launched!

00:08:09.570 --> 00:08:11.870
Releasing Orichalt from containment!

00:08:15.190 --> 00:08:16.460
Why?

00:08:16.460 --> 00:08:18.250
Why isn't the I-machine moving?

00:08:18.250 --> 00:08:20.230
The numbers are all normal...

00:08:20.580 --> 00:08:24.150
Yes, Alice's consciousness was
definitely transferred.

00:08:24.650 --> 00:08:25.610
It's fine.

00:08:25.610 --> 00:08:26.730
Alice is still alive.

00:08:26.730 --> 00:08:29.540
What about this is "alive"?

00:08:29.540 --> 00:08:32.790
Kain! Please, turn her back!

00:08:32.790 --> 00:08:34.510
You're the one who designed this, right?

00:08:34.510 --> 00:08:36.000
Bring Alice's consciousness back!

00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:37.210
K-Kain!

00:08:37.210 --> 00:08:39.460
There's a concentrating around
the Orichalt!

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:42.130
This shape...

00:08:42.130 --> 00:08:44.470
Alice!

00:08:44.470 --> 00:08:48.350
Alice's consciousness manifested
in the Orichalt?

00:08:48.350 --> 00:08:51.040
It's trying to build a body
it perceives itself as?

00:08:51.560 --> 00:08:53.440
What's going on?
What's happening?

00:08:53.440 --> 00:08:57.650
Alice! Alice! No!..

00:08:57.650 --> 00:08:59.020
It Miguel Jumped?

00:09:01.750 --> 00:09:05.500
Addams, how is Jennifer?

00:09:05.500 --> 00:09:08.060
She won't be leaving the hospital soon.

00:09:08.060 --> 00:09:10.360
The mental shock was just too strong.

00:09:10.360 --> 00:09:11.080
I see.

00:09:11.710 --> 00:09:12.870
It's a shame.

00:09:14.050 --> 00:09:17.350
Stopping the MT system's
development? Why?

00:09:17.350 --> 00:09:20.180
Our names would be forever
recorded in history!

00:09:20.180 --> 00:09:22.560
It's just a temporary break.

00:09:22.560 --> 00:09:27.810
After researching the atomic structure within the shards of the Orichalt that Alice's mind transferred into

00:09:27.810 --> 00:09:30.720
we've found traces of what appears to be an artificial material.

00:09:31.050 --> 00:09:34.770
Are you talking about that old theory, the Rajeev mechanism?

00:09:35.100 --> 00:09:35.980
Indeed.

00:09:35.980 --> 00:09:40.190
The Orichalt retrieval system from
an unknown space civilization.

00:09:40.190 --> 00:09:42.920
But there's no solid proof it exists!

00:09:42.920 --> 00:09:46.110
Same goes for the theoretical Amatsu
Mikaboshi that humanity could control...

00:09:46.110 --> 00:09:47.360
Addams.

00:09:47.360 --> 00:09:50.740
Who always comes out on top
in our arguments?

00:09:51.070 --> 00:09:52.200
Still...

00:09:52.200 --> 00:09:56.170
But we can't just stop using Miguel Jumps for space advance anymore!

00:09:56.170 --> 00:09:58.050
Even though they use Orichalt!

00:09:58.050 --> 00:09:59.920
It's until we discover the Orillian.

00:09:59.920 --> 00:10:01.210
Orillian?

00:10:01.210 --> 00:10:03.960
Humanoid-type Orichalt.

00:10:03.960 --> 00:10:05.780
Are you talking about Alice?

00:10:05.780 --> 00:10:06.590
I am.

00:10:06.590 --> 00:10:10.840
Until we discover it, we should stop all use of Orichalt, including Miguel Jum-

00:10:10.840 --> 00:10:12.180
You're always like that!

00:10:12.640 --> 00:10:15.270
Deciding thing and going through
with them all on your own!

00:10:15.270 --> 00:10:17.270
Of course, you're a genius, Kain.

00:10:17.270 --> 00:10:22.860
But without me and Jennifer the MT System
would've never advanced this far as a project!

00:10:22.860 --> 00:10:25.730
I have no skills as a businessman.
I am grateful to you two.

00:10:25.730 --> 00:10:27.150
No, you don't understand!

00:10:27.150 --> 00:10:30.990
If Orichalt use is stopped,
the economy will fall to ruin!

00:10:30.990 --> 00:10:32.870
Are you trying to destroy humanity?

00:10:32.870 --> 00:10:35.910
Why not? Around 90% wouldn't
be a problem.

00:10:35.910 --> 00:10:38.130
I always wanted data like that.

00:10:39.090 --> 00:10:39.960
You...

00:10:39.960 --> 00:10:40.750
Hm?

00:10:41.320 --> 00:10:45.690
Is that why you withdrew your
Rajeev paper back then?

00:10:46.320 --> 00:10:50.580
To wait until humanity builds a society with Orichalt at its core?

00:10:50.580 --> 00:10:53.570
A long-running scheme,
but it worked out quite nicely.

00:10:54.010 --> 00:10:54.930
It couldn't be...

00:10:55.640 --> 00:10:57.890
Was Alice... on purpose too?

00:10:57.890 --> 00:10:59.020
Of course.

00:10:59.020 --> 00:11:02.100
I'm quite pleased how good of an
Orillian she turned to be.

00:11:02.100 --> 00:11:03.310
You...

00:11:03.310 --> 00:11:06.730
I was against it, Jennifer was
the one who forced me to.

00:11:06.730 --> 00:11:08.690
Well, until the actual experiment.

00:11:08.690 --> 00:11:13.870
Addams, after removing the baggage attached
to Jennifer you can go after her...

00:11:13.870 --> 00:11:14.990
Kain!

00:11:16.910 --> 00:11:18.070
Addams!

00:11:18.070 --> 00:11:19.540
Stop messing around!

00:11:20.370 --> 00:11:22.390
You were the one who betrayed us!

00:11:22.390 --> 00:11:24.280
This is your sin!

00:11:24.280 --> 00:11:26.000
You can't stop humanity anymore!

00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:28.470
Yet you said it was worthless!

00:11:28.470 --> 00:11:29.750
The life of humans!

00:11:29.750 --> 00:11:31.050
I'll do it in your stead!

00:11:31.050 --> 00:11:34.590
As if I'd let someone who doesn't care about people at all do this!

00:11:35.090 --> 00:11:36.670
Stop it, Addams!

00:11:37.720 --> 00:11:40.950
If you perform a mind transfer with these parameters, there will be malfunctions!

00:11:40.950 --> 00:11:43.520
Stop it! Are you trying to make
a lab rat out of me?!

00:11:45.270 --> 00:11:47.110
K-Kain...

00:11:47.110 --> 00:11:49.510
Thank you for everything.

00:11:51.510 --> 00:11:52.740
Farewell.

00:12:06.510 --> 00:12:09.670
No good, they won't respond
no matter how much I call.

00:12:09.670 --> 00:12:11.080
Should we break right in?

00:12:11.080 --> 00:12:15.710
They said the security was strong,
we probably won't be of much use.

00:12:15.710 --> 00:12:18.840
Aah, if only sis Karla was here now!

00:12:22.670 --> 00:12:24.410
Mr. Ido! Mr. Ido!

00:12:24.410 --> 00:12:26.220
What did you do to him?

00:12:26.650 --> 00:12:28.140
Calm down.

00:12:28.140 --> 00:12:32.020
I want you, Mikuri Maya, to remember
what's going to happen here.

00:12:32.020 --> 00:12:33.040
Huh?

00:12:33.040 --> 00:12:35.930
There must be a reason why
you're here now.

00:12:36.330 --> 00:12:38.700
So I want you to be a witness.

00:12:38.700 --> 00:12:41.780
The person who knows the truth
about Addams and Kain.

00:12:42.160 --> 00:12:49.040
After transferring his mind to an I-machine, I brought him onto an exile ship under the guise of a test machine.

00:12:49.040 --> 00:12:52.960
As a machine that couldn't
even die, only think.

00:12:52.960 --> 00:12:53.920
That's cruel!

00:12:53.920 --> 00:12:55.880
To treat your best friend like that!

00:12:55.880 --> 00:12:56.860
Wrong!

00:12:56.860 --> 00:13:01.800
I couldn't bring myself to kill him exactly because
I still thought of him as an old friend!

00:13:02.770 --> 00:13:06.590
That's right, I wanted him
to still be alive.

00:13:07.040 --> 00:13:15.790
Now, let's both see just how he came to escape the exile ship and transfer his mind to another machine.

00:13:22.020 --> 00:13:24.610
Hahaha!

00:13:25.040 --> 00:13:25.990
I'm free!

00:13:26.340 --> 00:13:28.370
Free! I'm free!

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:29.940
I'm...

00:13:31.100 --> 00:13:32.500
Me...

00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:33.960
Myself?

00:13:34.810 --> 00:13:37.500
Who am I?

00:13:38.410 --> 00:13:40.360
What is this I-Machine?

00:13:40.360 --> 00:13:42.520
It's nothing but n/a's!

00:13:42.520 --> 00:13:44.050
The ID data...

00:13:44.050 --> 00:13:46.640
There is none?!

00:13:46.640 --> 00:13:49.040
What, Kain doesn't know himself?

00:13:49.450 --> 00:13:50.680
That's right...

00:13:50.680 --> 00:13:52.020
I remembered.

00:13:52.020 --> 00:13:59.480
It's the machine for detecting my ID data without using the Federation's database.

00:13:59.640 --> 00:14:02.850
A safety net in case there was a problem with a Mind Trance,

00:14:02.850 --> 00:14:06.150
made to recover the consciousness
of Kain Arisugawa.

00:14:06.500 --> 00:14:07.920
Unbelievable...

00:14:07.920 --> 00:14:10.410
You prepared something like
that just for yourself?

00:14:11.570 --> 00:14:14.270
And you kept this secret from
me and Jennifer...

00:14:14.270 --> 00:14:16.370
You are despicable!

00:14:16.370 --> 00:14:21.800
Yeah. I must've been a piece of shit,
not going to deny that.

00:14:22.120 --> 00:14:25.260
I can't remember my feelings and
thoughts at the time.

00:14:26.760 --> 00:14:31.220
But as for why I would recklessly
seek out Orichalt.

00:14:32.650 --> 00:14:35.480
I guess Kain must've had regrets.

00:14:35.980 --> 00:14:39.900
To find Alice, who turned into an Orillian
and disappeared to who knows where...

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:44.300
I think this thought must've been buried deep into my subliminal mind.

00:14:44.300 --> 00:14:47.380
Emotions? Or a lust for data?

00:14:47.740 --> 00:14:49.740
How should I know,
in my current state?

00:14:49.740 --> 00:14:52.400
Anyway, looks like your
memories are back.

00:14:52.400 --> 00:14:54.330
Congratulations, Kain!

00:14:54.330 --> 00:14:59.620
I want you to tell me. If you robbed me of my memories, why bring them back now?

00:14:59.620 --> 00:15:01.230
You know already!

00:15:01.230 --> 00:15:05.130
Now that you've found the Orillian, surely
you must have a plan about what to do

00:15:05.130 --> 00:15:08.930
with the wandering planet, Amatsu
Mikaboshi! Or rather, Rajeev!

00:15:08.930 --> 00:15:10.300
I have a plan.

00:15:10.300 --> 00:15:12.140
But I'm not telling you.

00:15:12.140 --> 00:15:12.720
Huh?

00:15:12.720 --> 00:15:14.640
You won't be able to accomplish it anyway.

00:15:14.640 --> 00:15:18.030
Aah, I missed this hubris of yours.

00:15:18.030 --> 00:15:23.060
But now I'm a person who made MT Industries the best in the world,

00:15:23.060 --> 00:15:25.640
connections to old man Hakubi who can pull political strings,

00:15:25.640 --> 00:15:27.820
and even capable of ordering
the army around!

00:15:27.820 --> 00:15:33.780
In that case, promise us our safety and give
the command of the plan to Grayman-

00:15:33.780 --> 00:15:35.740
That can wait!

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:36.690
Just look at this!

00:15:36.690 --> 00:15:39.710
Rajeev is already destroying Fifth!

00:15:39.710 --> 00:15:41.000
This is...

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:44.950
You didn't want the world to know,
and this is the result.

00:15:44.950 --> 00:15:49.670
You waited until Orichalt became
inseparable from human life on purpose

00:15:49.670 --> 00:15:52.860
to relish this apocalyptic sight, you devil!

00:15:52.860 --> 00:15:55.180
If you have the slightest trace
of conscience left, then...

00:15:55.180 --> 00:15:56.560
Then let me tell you!

00:15:56.560 --> 00:15:58.270
Abandon Orichalt!

00:15:58.270 --> 00:15:58.980
If you do that-

00:15:58.980 --> 00:15:59.790
Not a choice!

00:15:59.790 --> 00:16:02.090
The majority of people won't be saved!

00:16:02.090 --> 00:16:04.680
Are you going to say that 90% of humanity should die again?

00:16:04.680 --> 00:16:05.480
Are you?

00:16:05.480 --> 00:16:09.990
Even if there was a different way,
I wouldn't tell you.

00:16:09.990 --> 00:16:10.650
Kain!

00:16:11.060 --> 00:16:12.120
I'm not.

00:16:12.120 --> 00:16:13.220
I'm...

00:16:14.030 --> 00:16:16.580
Ido the Excavator!

00:16:17.160 --> 00:16:17.910
Mr. Ido!

00:16:18.420 --> 00:16:21.210
I'll make you guarantee
my comrades' safety.

00:16:21.210 --> 00:16:22.580
By force, if I need to!

00:16:23.920 --> 00:16:25.040
Comrades?

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:29.920
Using a word like that, you're certainly
no longer the Kain I knew before!

00:16:30.220 --> 00:16:31.720
Regrettable!

00:16:34.780 --> 00:16:38.720
I want to know: why do you use
Kain's body and name?

00:16:38.720 --> 00:16:39.460
I told you!

00:16:39.460 --> 00:16:41.020
Mercy and atonement!

00:16:41.020 --> 00:16:42.480
You're lying.

00:16:42.480 --> 00:16:45.210
You needed it to continue the business.

00:16:45.210 --> 00:16:47.020
Not the name of Addams, but Kain!

00:16:47.860 --> 00:16:52.840
Having used Kain's body and name for dozens of years, can you really still call yourself Addams?

00:16:54.350 --> 00:16:55.930
Whose fault do you think it is?

00:16:55.930 --> 00:16:57.240
I am myself!

00:16:57.720 --> 00:16:59.620
That's right, exactly!

00:16:59.620 --> 00:17:01.070
And I'm myself too!

00:17:01.070 --> 00:17:02.960
The one here right now!

00:17:02.960 --> 00:17:05.150
Don't liken me to a miner!

00:17:05.150 --> 00:17:08.630
My name is Addams Forte Chevalier.

00:17:08.630 --> 00:17:11.460
I will defeat you here,
and regain myself!

00:17:20.350 --> 00:17:23.270
Transferring backup data.

00:17:23.270 --> 00:17:24.810
You're always like this!

00:17:24.810 --> 00:17:26.960
Looking down and treating
me as inferior!

00:17:26.960 --> 00:17:28.450
But time has changed!

00:17:28.450 --> 00:17:29.570
I have improved!

00:17:29.570 --> 00:17:31.110
I must improve!

00:17:31.110 --> 00:17:33.030
For the sake of mankind!

00:17:34.900 --> 00:17:36.280
His accuracy got better!

00:17:36.280 --> 00:17:37.660
He's reading his movements!

00:17:37.940 --> 00:17:41.250
Kain, the devil treating humanity
as guinea pigs!

00:17:41.250 --> 00:17:44.540
Learn the power of mankind!

00:17:45.710 --> 00:17:46.860
Mr. Ido!

00:17:52.030 --> 00:17:58.160
Dear miner, was the fact my attacks started hitting a surprise?

00:17:58.160 --> 00:18:03.220
You must've taken a backup of my mind when you transferred me.

00:18:03.220 --> 00:18:06.560
Analyzing it, you learned
how I'd defend.

00:18:06.560 --> 00:18:10.930
Your mind truly is bright,
disgustingly so.

00:18:10.930 --> 00:18:12.320
But your correct!

00:18:17.450 --> 00:18:18.680
Enough of this.

00:18:18.680 --> 00:18:23.000
Against Rajeev, the countermeasures
I found 20 years ago will do.

00:18:23.000 --> 00:18:25.460
There will be sacrifices,
but we will prevail.

00:18:25.460 --> 00:18:28.710
Humanity will win, with me,
Addams, at their lead!

00:18:30.040 --> 00:18:30.980
He dodged?

00:18:31.920 --> 00:18:34.260
Once you know the trick,
countering is possible!

00:18:35.010 --> 00:18:36.010
Observation!

00:18:36.010 --> 00:18:36.880
Theory!

00:18:36.880 --> 00:18:37.930
Proof!

00:18:37.930 --> 00:18:39.250
The basics of science!

00:18:39.250 --> 00:18:40.810
Calling yourself a scientist?

00:18:40.810 --> 00:18:44.470
You're just a damn sentient toy
soldier cobbled together!

00:18:47.140 --> 00:18:50.240
And how will you respond to this?

00:18:50.240 --> 00:18:53.440
Act on my theory to get proof.

00:18:53.440 --> 00:18:54.190
What?

00:18:54.190 --> 00:18:55.610
What are you talking about?

00:18:57.740 --> 00:18:58.820
Ms. Karla!

00:18:58.820 --> 00:18:59.990
Run away! Quickly!

00:19:01.910 --> 00:19:03.450
Karla-Milla Foden.

00:19:03.910 --> 00:19:04.830
Karla!

00:19:06.660 --> 00:19:08.510
My comrades...

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:12.110
Are you trying to say you
won't abandon them?

00:19:16.170 --> 00:19:19.510
That's paying my debt for tricking you into coming here, Ido.

00:19:22.080 --> 00:19:24.810
These still won't do anything good!

00:19:25.140 --> 00:19:26.930
What about this then?

00:19:27.290 --> 00:19:29.310
All of the remaining energy!

00:19:29.310 --> 00:19:29.980
What?

00:19:36.160 --> 00:19:37.480
T-This is-

00:19:37.480 --> 00:19:39.450
You're a former scientist too.

00:19:39.670 --> 00:19:42.620
You should be able to make a theory based on observing this.

00:19:42.620 --> 00:19:48.120
Haha. Kain is really inside of you,
I'm certain now.

00:19:48.120 --> 00:19:50.920
And now, to give you proof!

00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:56.590
We'll meet again, Kain.

00:19:56.590 --> 00:19:58.750
How many times do
I have to say it?

00:19:58.750 --> 00:20:00.260
My name is Ido.

00:20:01.020 --> 00:20:02.930
Ido the Excavator!

00:20:12.450 --> 00:20:14.570
Do you think Mr. Ido is fine?

00:20:18.530 --> 00:20:20.020
Ms. Karla?

00:20:20.020 --> 00:20:23.530
Yeah. Are you two safe?

00:20:23.530 --> 00:20:24.750
Ms. Karla!

00:20:25.410 --> 00:20:27.950
You look just like your avatar
in expanded space.

00:20:39.930 --> 00:20:40.840
Ido.

00:20:41.280 --> 00:20:43.260
I'm sorry, I...

00:20:43.590 --> 00:20:46.180
I get it, don't say anything.

00:20:48.100 --> 00:20:50.890
Let's escape before they
come back.

00:20:52.170 --> 00:20:53.270
Are you okay?

00:20:53.680 --> 00:20:57.610
Yes. I'm just not used
to this body yet.

00:20:57.610 --> 00:21:00.940
Pretty weak of me,
don't you think?

00:21:01.760 --> 00:21:03.520
No, I don't...

00:21:07.740 --> 00:21:10.410
What's weak is your endgame, Kain.

00:21:15.340 --> 00:21:17.750
A-Addams...?

00:22:49.470 --> 00:22:53.180
Thanks to Kain's consciousness data
I've learned how to use the Orillian.

00:22:53.180 --> 00:22:56.180
If I include Kain's ideas in my plan...

00:22:57.440 --> 00:22:58.690
Humanity will prevail!

00:22:58.690 --> 00:22:59.820
It won't perish!

00:22:59.820 --> 00:23:01.020
I won't let it!

00:23:01.020 --> 00:23:02.060
Wait!

00:23:05.640 --> 00:23:07.050
Alice!

00:23:11.870 --> 00:23:14.850
She...jumped...

00:23:16.080 --> 00:23:17.540
Stop it...

00:23:17.540 --> 00:23:19.030
Addams...

00:23:20.040 --> 00:23:22.380
You can't do it...

00:23:25.760 --> 00:23:28.200
Those who exist create memories.

00:23:28.200 --> 00:23:30.850
Those who die leave traces.

00:23:30.850 --> 00:23:32.310
Who will perish?

00:23:32.310 --> 00:23:33.870
Who will be buried?

00:23:34.340 --> 00:23:39.350
In front of all of creation,
our sins are inevitable.
